// Microsoft Defender Disabled Through the Registry
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_defender_disabled_registry.yml (14b6859e-9eb3-43a8-aa86-f8800e921e97)
// Level: high. ATT&CK: T1685 Disable or Modify Tools
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"13") and (registry.path:"*\\Windows Defender\\*" and (registry.path like~ ("*\\DisableAntiSpyware", "*\\DisableAntiVirus", "*\\DisableRealtimeMonitoring", "*\\DisableBehaviorMonitoring", "*\\DisableIOAVProtection")) and registry.data.strings:"DWORD (0x00000001)")
